{
  "name": "Watch a website for new listings with Parse.bot, Google Sheets and Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "n001-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Watch a website for new listings with Parse.bot, Google Sheets and Slack\n\nMany sites you care about have no API. Parse.bot turns a website into one, and this workflow checks it on a schedule. New listings are saved to Google Sheets and posted to Slack, and items you have already seen are skipped. The example uses the public books.toscrape.com API from the Parse.bot marketplace.\n\n### How it works\n1. A schedule calls a Parse.bot API endpoint (for example list_books, page 1).\n2. The list in the response is split into one item per listing.\n3. Listings already seen in earlier runs are dropped.\n4. New listings are added to a Google Sheet.\n5. Slack gets one message with the count and titles.\n\n### Setup steps\n- [ ] Install the community node **n8n-nodes-parse-bot** (Settings > Community nodes)\n- [ ] Add your Parse.bot API key (parse.bot dashboard)\n- [ ] Find or build an API for your site, then copy its scraper ID and endpoint name\n- [ ] Adjust the list field in **One item per listing** to match the response\n- [ ] Create a sheet **Listings** (seen_at, title, price, url) and connect Sheets and Slack\n\n### Customization\nAdd filters (price, keyword) before saving, or call a details endpoint for each new listing.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 720
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n002-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "1. Fetch listings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        620,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Fetch listings\n\nCalls your Parse.bot website API on a schedule and splits the response into one item per listing.",
        "width": 840,
        "height": 370,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n006-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "2. Keep only new ones",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1500,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Keep only new ones\n\nDrops listings whose URL was already seen in a previous run, using n8n built-in deduplication.",
        "width": 320,
        "height": 370,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n008-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "3. Save and alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1860,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Save and alert\n\nAdds each new listing to the sheet and sends one Slack message with the count and titles.",
        "width": 840,
        "height": 370,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n003-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Every 6 hours",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 6
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "position": [
        680,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n004-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Get listings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-parse-bot.parseBot",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "scraper",
        "operation": "call",
        "scraperId": "0536619e-4158-4bf0-b7cb-e487156c47ed",
        "endpointName": "list_books",
        "method": "GET",
        "params": "{\"page\":1}"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "parseBotApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Parse.bot account"
        }
      },
      "position": [
        940,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n005-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "One item per listing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "data.books",
        "options": {}
      },
      "position": [
        1200,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n007-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Skip seen listings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "removeItemsSeenInPreviousExecutions",
        "dedupeValue": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "position": [
        1560,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n009-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Save listing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Listings"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "seen_at": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
            "title": "={{ $json.title }}",
            "price": "={{ $json.price }}",
            "url": "={{ $json.url }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "position": [
        1920,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n010-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Collect new listings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.aggregate",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "aggregate": "aggregateIndividualFields",
        "fieldsToAggregate": {
          "fieldToAggregate": [
            {
              "fieldToAggregate": "title",
              "renameField": true,
              "outputFieldName": "titles"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "position": [
        2180,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n011-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Post to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "#new-listings"
        },
        "text": "=:new: {{ $json.titles.length }} new listing(s): {{ $json.titles.slice(0, 10).join(', ') }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Slack account"
        }
      },
      "position": [
        2440,
        180
      ]
    }
  ],
